{"id":"4785","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4785_main_altostratus-translucidus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张照片是透光高层云的典型例子：一个灰色无特征层，水平范围很大，几乎覆盖整个天空。云层足够薄，通过云层可以看见太阳，被称为“地面玻璃效应”，但它足够厚，不会投射阴影。在30分钟内，该云层增厚，使太阳变得模糊，变成了蔽光高层云。云与南方的锋有关。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西圣布雷拉德Noirmont Common","latitude":"纬度: 49° 10' 13'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 10' 12'' W","date":"30 March 2016 1555 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 1, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.5.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.5.0"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4785_syn_altostratus-translucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在UTC时间1200点，浅层低压覆盖了北海。冷锋从波兰西北部延伸到法国北部，一直延伸至西班牙西北部和西班牙加那利群岛。比斯开湾北部出现弱波，西班牙北部出现浅低压。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4785_upper_altostratus-translucidus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测是来自法国布雷斯特，上游190公里，探测显示从表面到对流层顶接近饱和。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/radar/4785_radar_altostratus-translucidus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>泽西岛1635 UTC（照片拍摄后1小时40分钟）雷达的雷达图像显示了与法国北部地面相关的降雨。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 泽西岛2016年","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4785_sat_altostratus-translucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在UTC时间1408拍摄的NOAA视觉图像和UTC时间1615拍摄的Meteosat视觉图像清晰地显示了从法国北部到西班牙西北部存在一个与表面锋相关的经典前沿云带。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 鸣谢NOAA","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/grd/4785_grd_altostratus-translucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>另一个（Meteosat）1500 UTC时正面云带的视觉图像，从伊比利亚西南部延伸到西班牙西北部，然后再到法国北部和中欧。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}